(* Local nibble-glyph-1 payload-body grammar only; NOT glyph-graph-v1,
   MSS boundary syntax, a DDC trace, signed cochain or external standard.
   JSON Packet fields, UTF-8, alphabet, key, size and SHA checks are separate.
   Symbol is exactly one member of the declared sixteen-scalar alphabet.
   Number of pairs must equal the declared nonzero payload byte count. *)
body = pair, {pair} ;
pair = symbol, symbol ;
symbol = declared_alphabet_member ;
